      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- OS level storing key value pairs in the machine (env variable)\n- Put all the sensitive information in the OS in which my code is going to run\n \nPRACTICAL\n- Set up a basic spring boot project with gradle.\n- Figure out how can we read the port value from our system's env variables\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- OS level storing key value pairs in the machine (env variable)\n- Put all the sensitive information in the OS in which my code is going to run\n \nPRACTICAL\n- Set up a basic spring boot project with gradle.\n- Figure out how can we read the port value from our system's env variables\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8YNL3jXROw6OrOGv6tl7L",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 510.68073642645027,
