      "updated": 1779130789348,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- in Linux, we can do \nexport SAMPLE=12345\nto set a new env variable for a single terminal session\nLimitation: for a new session, we need to either set it again or find some other way\nThis mechanism only for linux and mac, not windows. \n\n\n\n${SERVER_PORT:8080}\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- in Linux, we can do \nexport SAMPLE=12345\nto set a new env variable for a single terminal session\nLimitation: for a new session, we need to either set it again or find some other way\nThis mechanism only for linux and mac, not windows. \n\n\n\n${SERVER_PORT:8080}\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
